20:16:49 [be46] 
20:16:49 [be46] Analyze this image and generate 5 supported expressive questions about the image for a child aged 5.
20:16:49 [be46] 
20:16:49 [be46] Keep questions concrete, visually grounded, and answerable with a short phrase or 1 simple sentence.
20:16:49 [be46] - Use supports such as sentence frames, example answers, and optional choices.
20:16:49 [be46] - Avoid too many abstract imagination questions.
20:16:49 [be46] - Do not require the child to infer hidden emotions, hidden intentions, or events that are not visible.
20:16:49 [be46] 
20:16:49 [be46] Developmental hierarchy:
20:16:49 [be46] 1. Labeling visible objects or people
20:16:49 [be46] 2. Describing visible actions
