20:16:49 [be46] - Avoid asking what happened before unless there is a very clear routine cue.
20:16:49 [be46] - Avoid "why" unless the reason is simple, familiar, and visually supported.
20:16:49 [be46] - Personal-experience questions are allowed only as optional extension questions, not as the main 5 questions.
